{"note_id":55,"date":"2025-04-10","note_type":"Systemic Therapy Note","content":"Genomic assay returned in the intermediate-high range, and adjuvant chemotherapy was recommended. Docetaxel/cyclophosphamide cycle 1 was administered on 2025-04-10. She tolerated infusion with expected fatigue and transient metallic taste, no febrile symptoms. Radiation oncology referral placed for adjuvant whole-breast radiation after completion of chemotherapy. Endocrine therapy to follow radiation. The patient asked whether the in situ component changes the main diagnosis; we reviewed that the invasive component drives prognosis and treatment planning.","summary":"Genomic assay showed intermediate-high risk and adjuvant chemotherapy with docetaxel/cyclophosphamide was initiated; the patient tolerated the first cycle with expected fatigue and metallic taste. A radiation oncology referral was placed for whole‑breast radiation after chemotherapy, with endocrine therapy planned thereafter. The patient was counseled that the invasive component, not the in‑situ component, drives prognosis and treatment planning.","concepts":{"cancer":{"presence":true,"confidence":"high","evidence":[{"note_id":55,"text":"adjuvant chemotherapy was recommended"},{"note_id":55,"text":"Docetaxel/cyclophosphamide cycle 1 was administered on 2025-04-10"},{"note_id":55,"text":"Radiation oncology referral placed for adjuvant whole-breast radiation after completion of chemotherapy"},{"note_id":55,"text":"the invasive component drives prognosis"}]},"metastasis":{"presence":false,"confidence":"high","evidence":[]},"surgery":{"presence":false,"confidence":"high","evidence":[]},"chemotherapy":{"presence":true,"confidence":"high","evidence":[{"note_id":55,"text":"Docetaxel/cyclophosphamide cycle 1 was administered on 2025-04-10"}]},"radiation":{"presence":true,"confidence":"high","evidence":[{"note_id":55,"text":"Radiation oncology referral placed for adjuvant whole-breast radiation after completion of chemotherapy"}]},"lymph_nodes_removed":{"presence":false,"confidence":"high","evidence":[]}},"cancer_status":["current"],"cancer_mentions":[{"presence":true,"confidence":"high","evidence":[{"note_id":55,"text":"adjuvant whole-breast radiation"}],"status":"current","affected_tissue":"breast","metastasis":false}],"flags":["genomic assay","adjuvant chemotherapy","docetaxel/cyclophosphamide","radiation referral","endocrine therapy","invasive carcinoma"]}

